%% Capacity and quota model - the objects Contoso operates, how they reference each other, and the ceiling that stops each one
%% Source: Microsoft Learn "Azure File Sync scale targets" and "Azure Files scale and performance targets" read 2026-09-03 for every hard and soft limit; codex/blueprint-azure-files-backup-protection.md for the vault tier limits; assessor rules DATA-03, DATA-04, DATA-06, TIER-04, AFS-07, AFS-09, AFS-10, AFS-16 in docs/RULES.md
